From: q2q port
Subject: [PATCH] q2q: rotated, scaled presentation (boot-arg sweetfb_rot)

The Z Fold3 inner panel scans 2208x1768 landscape. With sweetfb_rot=1 or 3 the
1125x2436 logical display is scaled to fit the upright panel (2208/2436, 1019x2208,
centered with black bars) and rotated 90 degrees one way or the other. Without the
boot-arg the copy is unchanged.

---
